{"seq":22,"slug":"assembly-language","title":"汇编语言与底层编程","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"汇编语言与底层编程\">汇编语言与底层编程</h1><p>汇编不是一门用来写整个应用的语言，而是一面镜子：它把高级语言里被编译器藏起来的东西原原本本照出来——一个变量到底落在寄存器还是栈上，一次函数调用搬动了多少字节，一个循环为什么慢、慢在哪条访存指令上。当你能读懂 <code>objdump</code> 吐出的那几行机器码，性能调优、崩溃定位、安全审计这些原本玄学的事情，会突然变成可以一行一行核对的工程问题。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 的四章是一条单向递进的路，每一章都建立在前一章的词汇之上，不要跳着读。</p>\n<p>第一章「<a href=\"foundations/\">基础</a>」打地基。没有 CPU 取指—译码—执行的循环模型，后面所有指令都是无源之水；没有寄存器与内存的分工，你无法理解为什么汇编满眼都是 <code>mov</code>；没有指令编码，你就看不懂反汇编里那一串十六进制到底是什么。这三篇分别锚定执行模型、存储模型、二进制编码三件地基。</p>\n<p>第二章「<a href=\"instructions/\">指令</a>」教你认字。指令分三类：搬运与计算数据的、改变执行顺序的、以及描述「操作数在哪」的寻址模式。把这三类拆开讲，是因为它们正交——任何一条真实指令都是「某个操作 + 某种寻址」的组合，先分别学清楚，再合起来读就毫不费力。</p>\n<p>第三章「<a href=\"abi/\">调用与 ABI</a>」是汇编与高级语言之间的合同。调用约定规定参数怎么传、谁负责保存寄存器；栈帧规定局部变量和返回地址怎么摆放；系统调用规定用户态程序如何越过边界请求内核服务。这一章解释的正是「C 函数编译出来为什么长那样」。</p>\n<p>第四章「<a href=\"practice/\">实践</a>」收口落地。SIMD 让你用一条指令同时算多个数据，是现代汇编最大的性能杠杆；内联汇编让你在 C/Rust 里精确插入几条指令；阅读反汇编则是把前三章的全部知识反向应用到真实二进制上的终极练习。</p>\n<p>读完这条路，你不会突然改用汇编写业务代码——也不该。你会得到的是一副能穿透抽象层的眼睛：看见编译器的产物，并在它出错或变慢时知道去哪里找答案。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cpu-execution-model","title":"CPU 与指令执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/foundations/cpu-execution-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"registers-memory","title":"寄存器与内存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/foundations/registers-memory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"instruction-encoding","title":"指令编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/foundations/instruction-encoding"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"instructions","title":"指令","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/instructions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-movement-arithmetic","title":"数据传送与算术指令","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/instructions/data-movement-arithmetic"},{"seq":2,"slug":"control-flow","title":"控制流与跳转","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/instructions/control-flow"},{"seq":3,"slug":"addressing-modes","title":"寻址模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/instructions/addressing-modes"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"abi","title":"调用与 ABI","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/abi","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"calling-conventions","title":"调用约定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/abi/calling-conventions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stack-frames","title":"栈帧与函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/abi/stack-frames"},{"seq":3,"slug":"system-calls","title":"系统调用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/abi/system-calls"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"simd-vectorization","title":"SIMD 与向量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/practice/simd-vectorization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inline-assembly","title":"内联汇编与互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/practice/inline-assembly"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reading-disassembly","title":"阅读反汇编","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/assembly-language/practice/reading-disassembly"}]}]}